      "description": "A plate on the sheet: hairline ring, offset soft outline, four registration crosshairs, mono credit below.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-paper\"><figure class=\"ds-plate\"><span class=\"ds-reg ds-tl\"></span><span class=\"ds-reg ds-tr\"></span><span class=\"ds-reg ds-bl\"></span><span class=\"ds-reg ds-br\"></span><div class=\"ds-sheet\"><div class=\"ds-sheet-head\"><b>Interesados de hoy</b><span>3 registros</span></div><div class=\"ds-sheet-row\"><span>21:15</span><b>Andrea M.</b><span>Galón de caucho blanco</span></div></div><figcaption class=\"ds-credit\"><span>Lámina 02 · Registro</span><span>Datos de ejemplo</span></figcaption></figure></div>",
      "css": ".ds-paper{padding:40px;background:#f7f7f7;}.ds-plate{position:relative;margin:0;color:#0e2358;font-family:'Hanken Grotesk','Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-sheet{background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #c9c7c4;outline:1px solid #dcdad6;outline-offset:10px;}.ds-sheet-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:20px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid #dcdad6;}.ds-sheet-head b{font-weight:500;font-size:18px;}.ds-sheet-head span,.ds-credit{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#3d4a6b;}.ds-sheet-row{display:flex;gap:24px;padding:16px 24px;font-size:15px;}.ds-sheet-row b{font-weight:500;}.ds-credit{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:14px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid #c9c7c4;}.ds-reg{position:absolute;width:21px;height:21px;}.ds-reg::before,.ds-reg::after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#0e2358;}.ds-reg::before{left:10px;top:0;width:1px;height:21px;}.ds-reg::after{top:10px;left:0;height:1px;width:21px;}.ds-tl{top:-22px;left:-22px;}.ds-tr{top:-22px;right:-22px;}.ds-bl{bottom:20px;left:-22px;}.ds-br{bottom:20px;right:-22px;}"
    },
    {
